cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "MDRG: Graph-Riemannian Multi-View Fusion for Subject-Specific EEG Imagined Speech Decoding"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-23
abstract: >-
  Subject-specific decoders for the five-command BCIC2020-IV imagined speech
  benchmark: a compact raw-EEG network, a 1656-dimensional graph-Riemannian
  multi-view descriptor, their decision-level fusion, a multi-view graph
  comparator and a pretrained-encoder baseline, all selected on the official
  validation split and scored once on the official test split.
authors:
